(7000390, 1058492, 129512, '<td valign="top">I guess Icarus fell after all. Great idea but there is something ''off''. The background doesn''t seem natural and the lighting underneath the left wing irks me. <br/> <br/>That being said, I do like the feathers and overall idea for the image.</td>', 'I guess Icarus fell after all. Great idea but there is something ''off''. The background doesn''t seem natural and the lighting underneath the left wing irks me.  That being said, I do like the feathers and overall idea for the image.', '2013-03-15 00:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
