(7000681, 1058571, 54446, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Very sinister and evil looking.  But, then, art sometimes reveals truth.  9</td>', 'Well done.  Very sinister and evil looking.  But, then, art sometimes reveals truth.  9', '2013-03-15 09:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000682, 1058379, 54446, '<td valign="top">No longer sea worthy, I''d guess.  Meets the challenge exceptionally well.  Love the painterly presentation.  The border is a plus.  9</td>', 'No longer sea worthy, I''d guess.  Meets the challenge exceptionally well.  Love the painterly presentation.  The border is a plus.  9', '2013-03-15 09:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000683, 1058549, 54446, '<td valign="top">True enough.  8</td>', 'True enough.  8', '2013-03-15 09:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000684, 1058393, 54446, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit harsh and the background a bit ontrived.  But, much better than most of the entries in this challenge.  8</td>', 'The light is a bit harsh and the background a bit ontrived.  But, much better than most of the entries in this challenge.  8', '2013-03-15 09:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000685, 1058286, 54446, '<td valign="top">A cottonwood, perhaps?  Love your idea for this challenge.  Works well for me.  8</td>', 'A cottonwood, perhaps?  Love your idea for this challenge.  Works well for me.  8', '2013-03-15 09:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000686, 1058578, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  Well presented.  8</td>', 'Very creative.  Well presented.  8', '2013-03-15 09:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000687, 1058548, 54446, '<td valign="top">Compelling image.  Very creative.  8</td>', 'Compelling image.  Very creative.  8', '2013-03-15 09:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000688, 1057350, 92577, '<td valign="top">Intriguing image. I can imagine people looking at this hanging on a wall and discussing it.</td>', 'Intriguing image. I can imagine people looking at this hanging on a wall and discussing it.', '2013-03-15 09:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000692, 1058484, 92577, '<td valign="top">Would make a great poster.</td>', 'Would make a great poster.', '2013-03-15 09:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000695, 1058172, 92577, '<td valign="top">Wonderful</td>', 'Wonderful', '2013-03-15 09:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000710, 1058382, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, perhaps a little too dark (but it may just read that way because of all the dark lines).  The jigsaw filter is always cool, however, I don''t see any concept of "falling apart"  Yes, there is a drop shadow and a little motion blur on the lower pieces (that is distracting).  You could have, for example, had the complete puzzle "falling apart" into various chunks at different angles and still used the filter.  So I would give this a 7, but since it did not meet the challenge a -3 brings this to a 4.</td>', 'Nice portrait, perhaps a little too dark (but it may just read that way because of all the dark lines).  The jigsaw filter is always cool, however, I don''t see any concept of "falling apart"  Yes, there is a drop shadow and a little motion blur on the lower pieces (that is distracting).  You could have, for example, had the complete puzzle "falling apart" into various chunks at different angles and still used the filter.  So I would give this a 7, but since it did not meet the challenge a -3 brings this to a 4.', '2013-03-15 10:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000713, 1057923, 49954, '<td valign="top">Lighting is harsh, focus is a but off and a single petal is falling off, but not much impact.</td>', 'Lighting is harsh, focus is a but off and a single petal is falling off, but not much impact.', '2013-03-15 10:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000716, 1058562, 49954, '<td valign="top">Whoa, nice work.  Where''s the head!!!  Excellent job here.  Congrats.</td>', 'Whoa, nice work.  Where''s the head!!!  Excellent job here.  Congrats.', '2013-03-15 10:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000717, 1058514, 49954, '<td valign="top">Ok, this strikes me as a gyaban entry -- so very good.  Nice lighting and editing...</td>', 'Ok, this strikes me as a gyaban entry -- so very good.  Nice lighting and editing...', '2013-03-15 10:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000719, 1058172, 49954, '<td valign="top">I have to read a lot in this to get "Falling Apart"... like the woman is estranged from her SO and  "falling apart".  But without the title and challenge theme, this image, to me, does nothing to convey that.</td>', 'I have to read a lot in this to get "Falling Apart"... like the woman is estranged from her SO and  "falling apart".  But without the title and challenge theme, this image, to me, does nothing to convey that.', '2013-03-15 10:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000720, 1058545, 49954, '<td valign="top">Are they supposed to be "fallen" perhaps?  Otherwise I don''t get it and it looks to me like a gang meeting or something.</td>', 'Are they supposed to be "fallen" perhaps?  Otherwise I don''t get it and it looks to me like a gang meeting or something.', '2013-03-15 10:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000723, 1058561, 49954, '<td valign="top">First off, if that''s Sodoku Rubik''s Cube that''s just plain evil!  Processing and shadows a bit harsh.  I get more a sense of coming apart not "falling apart" as it looks pretty new.</td>', 'First off, if that''s Sodoku Rubik''s Cube that''s just plain evil!  Processing and shadows a bit harsh.  I get more a sense of coming apart not "falling apart" as it looks pretty new.', '2013-03-15 10:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000724, 1058538, 49954, '<td valign="top">Very nice artwork, but personally I''m not seeing "falling apart" in this at all.</td>', 'Very nice artwork, but personally I''m not seeing "falling apart" in this at all.', '2013-03-15 10:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000725, 1057265, 49954, '<td valign="top">interesting and haunting image.  Not sure how well it''s conveying the theme though.</td>', 'interesting and haunting image.  Not sure how well it''s conveying the theme though.', '2013-03-15 10:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000726, 1058534, 49954, '<td valign="top">I guess that''s supposed to be a nervous breakdown "falling apart" in the midst of a crosswalk?</td>', 'I guess that''s supposed to be a nervous breakdown "falling apart" in the midst of a crosswalk?', '2013-03-15 10:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000727, 1058568, 49954, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the challenge.  Lovely bokeh too.</td>', 'Very nice take on the challenge.  Lovely bokeh too.', '2013-03-15 10:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000729, 1058498, 49954, '<td valign="top">Harsh image that does not convey "Falling Apart" to me at all.  The cut glass it too perfect.  However, as nitpicky as this is, it''s DNMC because the title was required to be "Falling Apart".  So a 4 for the image quality -3 for DNMC = 1 (sorry)!</td>', 'Harsh image that does not convey "Falling Apart" to me at all.  The cut glass it too perfect.  However, as nitpicky as this is, it''s DNMC because the title was required to be "Falling Apart".  So a 4 for the image quality -3 for DNMC = 1 (sorry)!', '2013-03-15 10:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000736, 1058571, 49954, '<td valign="top">Interesting take and it does seem to reflect "Falling Apart" however the processing (while well edited) is a bit unbelievable in the sense that the "crackle finish" appears to be an overlay instead of being a part of the actual contour of the man''s face.  In that case it could be a "painting that is falling apart" but as it''s not doing so in the hoodie area -- just his face -- I don''t believe that''s the intent.<br/> <br/>He''s also not reacting at all to his face falling apart, so that kills the effect for me.</td>', 'Interesting take and it does seem to reflect "Falling Apart" however the processing (while well edited) is a bit unbelievable in the sense that the "crackle finish" appears to be an overlay instead of being a part of the actual contour of the man''s face.  In that case it could be a "painting that is falling apart" but as it''s not doing so in the hoodie area -- just his face -- I don''t believe that''s the intent. He''s also not reacting at all to his face falling apart, so that kills the effect for me.', '2013-03-15 10:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000744, 1058594, 124815, '<td valign="top">Silent drama. A great procession at wee hours.<br/>The background could have borrowed some hues.<br/>Did you really need the border?</td>', 'Silent drama. A great procession at wee hours.The background could have borrowed some hues.Did you really need the border?', '2013-03-15 10:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7000746, 1058538, 124815, '<td valign="top">truly worth its title</td>', 'truly worth its title', '2013-03-15 10:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
