(7002249, 1058534, 38032, '<td valign="top">This fractured miniseries of moments walks a tightrope between mundane happenstance and life-changing anxiety possibly approaching a love triangle. What makes it especially interesting is that it''s tough to tell whether this could have possibly been done with a long shutter or if there was multiple exposures layered togehther in post. <br/>The monstrous distortions in face on the character in the center almost seems to reflect an inner turmoil tugging her between scenarios where none of her choices can ever turn out well.<br/>9</td>', 'This fractured miniseries of moments walks a tightrope between mundane happenstance and life-changing anxiety possibly approaching a love triangle. What makes it especially interesting is that it''s tough to tell whether this could have possibly been done with a long shutter or if there was multiple exposures layered togehther in post. The monstrous distortions in face on the character in the center almost seems to reflect an inner turmoil tugging her between scenarios where none of her choices can ever turn out well.9', '2013-03-18 09:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
