(7002340, 1057865, 63218, '<td valign="top">The green color should dominate this comp, but it seems only to dominate &amp; unify the visual clutter of a big city sidewalk, &amp; it''s the line of people that captures &amp; holds my attention. The effect of the reflection is to make the people into a march. I think you are taking street photography into an interesting/refreshing direction that is uniquely yours. The elements in the FG of this shot take it out of the box of simple physical reflection &amp; into the more interesting expression of personal reflection, adding light &amp; shadow that lead my eye into the line of people.<br/> <br/>The bottom line: instant fav! And that''s almost all I wrote for a comment.</td>', 'The green color should dominate this comp, but it seems only to dominate & unify the visual clutter of a big city sidewalk, & it''s the line of people that captures & holds my attention. The effect of the reflection is to make the people into a march. I think you are taking street photography into an interesting/refreshing direction that is uniquely yours. The elements in the FG of this shot take it out of the box of simple physical reflection & into the more interesting expression of personal reflection, adding light & shadow that lead my eye into the line of people. The bottom line: instant fav! And that''s almost all I wrote for a comment.', '2013-03-18 12:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7002346, 1057974, 63218, '<td valign="top">We spend years, as children, learning to see. But sometimes I wonder how I saw things before I learned to see what I expect to see. Maybe it was more expressionistic, maybe I could see blur, I can''t remember. By now, I see only what I know is already there &amp; my only hope to see in other ways is the camera. And comps like this. So, thanks.</td>', 'We spend years, as children, learning to see. But sometimes I wonder how I saw things before I learned to see what I expect to see. Maybe it was more expressionistic, maybe I could see blur, I can''t remember. By now, I see only what I know is already there & my only hope to see in other ways is the camera. And comps like this. So, thanks.', '2013-03-18 12:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7002350, 1057222, 63218, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, excellent PP also.</td>', 'Excellent capture, excellent PP also.', '2013-03-18 12:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
