(7002445, 1057265, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is like a dream, when you dream you''re dreaming. Then you dream you wake up. When you do wake up for real, the whole dream goes through your head like an uptown express train in a swirl of used hot air &amp; bits of paper, leaving you feeling confused. And thirsty.</td>', 'This is like a dream, when you dream you''re dreaming. Then you dream you wake up. When you do wake up for real, the whole dream goes through your head like an uptown express train in a swirl of used hot air & bits of paper, leaving you feeling confused. And thirsty.', '2013-03-18 16:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7002447, 1058172, 63218, '<td valign="top">This looks like a very nice bar, where an orange parka would be unusual. The orange is a great color for this shot, though.</td>', 'This looks like a very nice bar, where an orange parka would be unusual. The orange is a great color for this shot, though.', '2013-03-18 16:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7002449, 1058331, 63218, '<td valign="top">Inspired! I like it that you left the egg in the slicer &amp; appreciate that it wouldn''t move very successfully. It''s like a strange little flower that would fall apart if touched. I imagine your kitchen as a wonderful place, where people just want to be and be with you.</td>', 'Inspired! I like it that you left the egg in the slicer & appreciate that it wouldn''t move very successfully. It''s like a strange little flower that would fall apart if touched. I imagine your kitchen as a wonderful place, where people just want to be and be with you.', '2013-03-18 16:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7002453, 1058594, 63218, '<td valign="top">oh! I love bare trees! Really nice eye-movement pathways in this &amp; a glorious combination of subtle color &amp; light. Well done.</td>', 'oh! I love bare trees! Really nice eye-movement pathways in this & a glorious combination of subtle color & light. Well done.', '2013-03-18 16:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7002468, 1058505, 63218, '<td valign="top">More fun to view from a distance, where I can use my imagination to see the part.</td>', 'More fun to view from a distance, where I can use my imagination to see the part.', '2013-03-18 17:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7002815, 1057350, 108580, '<td valign="top">The use of light to portray the challenge DMC. Unusually smooth and flowing. Almost geometrical</td>', 'The use of light to portray the challenge DMC. Unusually smooth and flowing. Almost geometrical', '2013-03-19 13:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7002828, 1058537, 108580, '<td valign="top">...with Laughter? :P</td>', '...with Laughter? :P', '2013-03-19 13:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7002830, 1058484, 108580, '<td valign="top">Fantastic Digital Art. And a Duke to boot! I''ll give you a 10 if you do a "<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/how.php" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">How''d They Do That?</a>" :)</td>', 'Fantastic Digital Art. And a Duke to boot! I''ll give you a 10 if you do a "How''d They Do That?" :)', '2013-03-19 13:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7002831, 1058565, 108580, '<td valign="top">Morphed faces. Ghoulish.</td>', 'Morphed faces. Ghoulish.', '2013-03-19 13:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003421, 1057297, 27812, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion; I think a starker contrast would have played better in this challenge. Good work with basic creativity. 9.</td>', 'Just my opinion; I think a starker contrast would have played better in this challenge. Good work with basic creativity. 9.', '2013-03-20 03:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003423, 1058331, 27812, '<td valign="top">Looks like a breakfast argument. Well done.</td>', 'Looks like a breakfast argument. Well done.', '2013-03-20 03:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003424, 1058565, 27812, '<td valign="top">Very creative from my personal point of view. Abnormal cell growth=cancer. But then also, a great divide etc etc. I like the creativity and the composition.Would make a fantastic poster size print. Crank the Levels and luminosity.9.</td>', 'Very creative from my personal point of view. Abnormal cell growth=cancer. But then also, a great divide etc etc. I like the creativity and the composition.Would make a fantastic poster size print. Crank the Levels and luminosity.9.', '2013-03-20 03:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003425, 1058594, 27812, '<td valign="top">Another superb example of photographic fine art without the extreme manipulation of pixels. 9.</td>', 'Another superb example of photographic fine art without the extreme manipulation of pixels. 9.', '2013-03-20 03:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003427, 1058454, 27812, '<td valign="top">Difficult one; the center line composition distracts and does not add what could possibly be a dynamic energy. 16:9 Ratio? 8</td>', 'Difficult one; the center line composition distracts and does not add what could possibly be a dynamic energy. 16:9 Ratio? 8', '2013-03-20 03:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003534, 1058539, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is kind of that that question "What''s the difference between an orange?" - except this if more original and interesting.</td>', 'This is kind of that that question "What''s the difference between an orange?" - except this if more original and interesting.', '2013-03-20 08:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003536, 1058587, 38032, '<td valign="top">Awesome! will be under-rated but it is a fun image for sure. If it weren''t for my wife, this would look more familiar.</td>', 'Awesome! will be under-rated but it is a fun image for sure. If it weren''t for my wife, this would look more familiar.', '2013-03-20 08:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003539, 1058497, 82138, '<td valign="top">Great shot and editing. I can really relate to this photo. I''m calling blue on this one.</td>', 'Great shot and editing. I can really relate to this photo. I''m calling blue on this one.', '2013-03-20 08:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7003610, 1058562, 156185, '<td valign="top">Nice Work</td>', 'Nice Work', '2013-03-20 10:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7004038, 1058437, 158576, '<td valign="top">I like the way this represents "Falling Apart", but I wish you would have cropped a little differently so the man was more prominent.</td>', 'I like the way this represents "Falling Apart", but I wish you would have cropped a little differently so the man was more prominent.', '2013-03-20 18:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7004039, 1058558, 158576, '<td valign="top">I love the pathos that the doll adds to this shot.</td>', 'I love the pathos that the doll adds to this shot.', '2013-03-20 18:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7004040, 1058555, 158576, '<td valign="top">This is such a gripping moment. You can feel the anguish and sorrow displayed here.</td>', 'This is such a gripping moment. You can feel the anguish and sorrow displayed here.', '2013-03-20 18:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7004041, 1058497, 158576, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, but I think it would have had more of an impact with motion blur.</td>', 'Nicely done, but I think it would have had more of an impact with motion blur.', '2013-03-20 18:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7004044, 1058512, 158576, '<td valign="top">It''s a good shot, but to me it says "empty and lonely" more than "Falling Apart".</td>', 'It''s a good shot, but to me it says "empty and lonely" more than "Falling Apart".', '2013-03-20 18:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7004047, 1058531, 158576, '<td valign="top">A little too "blue" and too much contrast for my taste.</td>', 'A little too "blue" and too much contrast for my taste.', '2013-03-20 18:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7004048, 1058371, 158576, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but wonder if your intent was to make an interesting "Falling Apart" photo, or if you were making a statement about the state of the site.</td>', 'I can''t help but wonder if your intent was to make an interesting "Falling Apart" photo, or if you were making a statement about the state of the site.', '2013-03-20 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7004049, 1058583, 158576, '<td valign="top">This just reminds me of a "schlocky" special effect that might have been seen in a 60''s era, low budget, scifi television show.</td>', 'This just reminds me of a "schlocky" special effect that might have been seen in a 60''s era, low budget, scifi television show.', '2013-03-20 18:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
